{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "钥匙的一生",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 142.18,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "一把密钥，要经过生成、存储、使用、备份、轮换和销毁。",
   "spoken": "一把密钥，要经过生成、存储、使用、备份、轮换和销毁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 7.436
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "每一步，都出过真实事故。",
   "spoken": "每一步，都出过真实事故。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 8.492,
   "dur": 2.952,
   "speechStart": 8.59,
   "speechEnd": 10.601
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "先看生成。",
   "spoken": "先看生成。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.664,
   "dur": 1.896,
   "speechStart": 11.762,
   "speechEnd": 12.726
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "Profanity 是一个靶号地址生成器。",
   "spoken": "Profanity 是一个靶号地址生成器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.78,
   "dur": 3.312,
   "speechStart": 13.878,
   "speechEnd": 16.259
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "它的随机种子只有 32 位，约 43 亿种，私钥可以被 GPU 反推。",
   "spoken": "它的随机种子只有 32 位，约 43 亿种，私钥可以被 GPU 反推。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.312,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 17.41,
   "speechEnd": 23.136
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "2022 年 9 月，1inch 公开了这个问题。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 9 月，1inch 公开了这个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.204,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 24.302,
   "speechEnd": 27.337
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "Wintermute 把这样一个地址，用作金库的管理员。",
   "spoken": "Wintermute 把这样一个地址，用作金库的管理员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.408,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 28.506,
   "speechEnd": 31.744
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "披露后，它转走了地址里的 ETH，却没有撤销管理员权限。",
   "spoken": "批路后，它转走了地址里的 ETH，却没有撤销管理员权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 32.804,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 32.902,
   "speechEnd": 37.235
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "约 5 天后，金库被盗约 1.6 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "约 5 天后，金库被盗约 1.6 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 38.304,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 38.402,
   "speechEnd": 41.473
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "转走余额，不等于消除风险，权限也要撤销。",
   "spoken": "转走余额，不等于消除风险，权限也要撤销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 42.532,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 42.63,
   "speechEnd": 46.475
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "资金地址要在可信硬件里生成，不用靶号工具。",
   "spoken": "资金地址要在可信硬件里生成，不用靶号工具。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.528,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 47.626,
   "speechEnd": 51.292
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "再看存储。",
   "spoken": "再看存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.356,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 52.454,
   "speechEnd": 53.335
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "2022 年 8 月，Slope 钱包把助记词以明文发到自己的日志服务器。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 8 月，Slope 钱包把助记词以明文发到自己的日志服务器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 54.448,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 54.546,
   "speechEnd": 59.569
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "Solana 官方通报，约 9231 个钱包受影响，损失约 410 万美元。",
   "spoken": "Solana 官方通报，约 9231 个钱包受影响，损失约 410 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 60.644,
   "dur": 6.6,
   "speechStart": 60.742,
   "speechEnd": 66.396
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "日志、崩溃上报、遥测，都是密钥的泄露通道。",
   "spoken": "日志、崩溃上报、遥测，都是密钥的泄漏通道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 67.464,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 67.562,
   "speechEnd": 71.812
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "客户端要在采集这一端，就把密钥材料屏蔽掉。",
   "spoken": "客户端要在采集这一端，就把密钥材料屏蔽掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 72.868,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 72.966,
   "speechEnd": 76.585
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "钱包的发布链路，也是一把钥匙。",
   "spoken": "钱包的发布链路，也是一把钥匙。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 77.624,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 77.722,
   "speechEnd": 80.055
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "2025 年 12 月，Trust Wallet 的浏览器扩展，有一个恶意版本出现在 Chrome 商店。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 12 月，Trust Wallet 的浏览器扩展，有一个恶意版本出现在 Chrome 商店。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 81.108,
   "dur": 6.696,
   "speechStart": 81.206,
   "speechEnd": 86.968
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "它导出扩展里所有钱包的助记词，约 850 万美元被盗。",
   "spoken": "它导出扩展里所有钱包的助记词，约 850 万美元被盗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 88.024,
   "dur": 5.136,
   "speechStart": 88.122,
   "speechEnd": 92.336
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "项目方称，攻击者用泄露的 GitHub secrets，拿到商店的 API Key。",
   "spoken": "项目方称，攻击者用泄漏的 GitHub secrets，拿到商店的 API Key。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 93.38,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 93.478,
   "speechEnd": 98.668
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "发布凭证和 CI 密钥，本身就是资金级的资产。",
   "spoken": "发布凭证和 CI 密钥，本身就是资金级的资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 99.72,
   "dur": 4.296,
   "speechStart": 99.818,
   "speechEnd": 103.175
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "最后看备份和分片。",
   "spoken": "最后看备份和分片。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 104.236,
   "dur": 2.736,
   "speechStart": 104.334,
   "speechEnd": 106.119
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "2023 年 7 月，Multichain 的 MPC 地址出现异常转出，约 1.26 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 7 月，Multichain 的 MPC 地址出现异常转出，约 1.26 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 107.192,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 107.29,
   "speechEnd": 113.242
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "项目方声明，全部 MPC 节点服务器，都在 CEO 的个人云账户上。",
   "spoken": "项目方声明，全部 MPC 节点服务器，都在 CEO 的个人云账户上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 114.3,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 114.398,
   "speechEnd": 119.612
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "CEO 被警方带走后，团队无法登录。",
   "spoken": "CEO 被警方带走后，团队无法登录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-24.mp3",
   "start": 120.664,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 120.762,
   "speechEnd": 123.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-25",
   "text": "外部攻击或内部转移，外界有争议，没有官方定性。",
   "spoken": "外部攻击或内部转移，外界有争议，没有官方定性。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-25.mp3",
   "start": 124.94,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 125.038,
   "speechEnd": 129.133
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-26",
   "text": "MPC 的前提是分片独立，分片都在一个人手里，门限只是名义上的。",
   "spoken": "MPC 的前提是分片独立，分片都在一个人手里，门限只是名义上的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-26.mp3",
   "start": 130.2,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 130.298,
   "speechEnd": 135.405
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-27",
   "text": "分片要放在不同组织、不同地域、不同云账户。",
   "spoken": "分片要放在不同组织、不同地域、不同云账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep18/audio/lines/seg3-27.mp3",
